                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Barlow, United
                        States marshal, to Mr. Fishy Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 7,
                        1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hamilton Fish</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Secretary of State:</hi></p>
                <p>Telegram just received. I will at once inquire.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FRANCIS C. BARLOW,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">United States
                            Marshal.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
